== 2. the centre field is the ball radius of the edge ==
 rho=0.5: 1/cosh=8.868189e-01  (1-G^2)/(1+G^2)=8.868189e-01
 rho=1: 1/cosh=6.480543e-01  (1-G^2)/(1+G^2)=6.480543e-01
 rho=2: 1/cosh=2.658022e-01  (1-G^2)/(1+G^2)=2.658022e-01
 rho=10: 1/cosh=9.079986e-05  (1-G^2)/(1+G^2)=9.079986e-05
 rho=50: 1/cosh=3.857500e-22  (1-G^2)/(1+G^2)=0.000000e+00
 Ink's numbers, lambda = 1 mm: L=4 -> 0.2658  L=20 -> 9.08e-05  L=100 -> 3.86e-22

== 3. the wall is the one-third shell ==
 wall rapidity ln(3+2 sqrt2) = 1.7627471740, arccosh(3) = 1.7627471740, Gamma^2 = 0.5000000000, centre field = 0.3333333333
 so a wound of width L = 2 ln(3+2 sqrt2) lambda = 3.525494 lambda keeps exactly 1/3 of the edge field at its centre

